{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "管教障碍：不知道正确做法", "content": "许多家长不知道应该怎么做，脑子里没有正确管教的记忆或模式，只知道什么是错的，不知道什么是对的，导致被动，知道孩子需要管教却不敢管教。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["管教障碍", "知识缺乏"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e3d3031f10c2-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e3d3031f10c2", "blocks": ["b00001"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e3d3031f10c2-c001:a003", "kind": "supports", "condition": "学习管教知识可解决不知道正确做法的问题", "reason": "a001指出家长缺乏正确管教知识，a003说明学习能带来底气，暗示学习可弥补知识缺乏。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-c-20", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：排查障碍中「不知道怎么做」这一项时。", "reason": "补充了不知道正确管教模式、只知道错误做法的具体困境。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e3d3031f10c2-c001:u001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
